              "message" : "<h2 id=\"use-pgql-to-query-the-graph\">Use PGQL to query the graph</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://pgql-lang.org\">PGQL</a> - Property Graph Query Language; a SQL-like language for graph pattern-matching.</p>\n",
